            "author": "jessepbuilds",
            "region": "NL",
            "shares": 407,
            "caption": "Day 3 of building my AI trading bot in public. Today: the control room. This is where every strategy my AI comes up with will be tested, 24/7. ⚙️ 3 CPU cores run strategies candle by candle on 1-minute data ⚖️ A judge in plain code kills anything that only worked by luck 📉 Out of 1,245 ideas, maybe 2 survive. That's the point. 📒 Every test gets logged, the failures too, so the AI learns what actually works 🛠️ Later today I'm posting the full blueprint of how the engine works, part by part. AI only proposes. Plain code judges. #tradingbot #algotrading #aitrading #futurestrading #buildinpublic  ",
